## Monitoring Endpoints

`lament-api` exposes automated health endpoints for uptime monitoring services (such as UptimeRobot or Better Stack):

### 1. Health Status (`GET /health`)

```json
{
  "s": 1,
  "runtime": "edge"
}
```

### 2. Ping (`GET /ping`)

```json
{
  "pong": true,
  "ts": 1724985600000
}
```

---

## Log Tailing

Tail live production logs from Cloudflare Workers edge nodes:

```bash
cd lament-api
bunx wrangler tail
```
